### 5.2 Query Optimization Priority

```
HIGH IMPACT (fix first):
  1. Badge count debouncing → eliminates 80% of redundant queries
  2. Profile caching → eliminates 3-5 duplicate fetches per navigation
  3. FloatingChatbot wildcard → eliminates unbounded realtime events
  4. ApplicationHub server-side join → eliminates O(n×m) client computation

MEDIUM IMPACT:
  5. Pagination on all list views → prevents browser crashes at scale
  6. Column selection (replace select('*') with specific columns) → reduces payload
  7. auth.getUser() consolidation → eliminates 3-5 redundant auth calls

LOW IMPACT:
  8. Optimistic updates on mutations (toast immediately, sync in background)
  9. Prefetching on hover (load next page's data before click)
