### 7.2 Enterprise Search Architecture

```
TIER 1: Database-level search (pg_trgm)
  CREATE EXTENSION pg_trgm;
  
  Fuzzy name search:
    CREATE INDEX idx_candidates_name_trgm ON candidates USING GIN (full_name gin_trgm_ops);
    SELECT * FROM candidates WHERE full_name % 'John Doe' ORDER BY similarity(full_name, 'John Doe') DESC LIMIT 20;
  
  Email prefix search:
    SELECT * FROM candidates WHERE email ILIKE 'john%' LIMIT 20;
    (B-tree index on email handles prefix matching)

TIER 2: Frontend debounced search
  const debouncedSearch = useDebouncedCallback((term) => {
    queryClient.fetchQuery(['candidates', 'search', term], () =>
      supabase.rpc('search_candidates', { search_term: term, page_size: 20 })
    );
  }, 300); // 300ms debounce

TIER 3: Search RPC function (server-side)
  CREATE FUNCTION search_candidates(search_term TEXT, page_size INT DEFAULT 20)
  RETURNS SETOF candidates AS $$
    SELECT * FROM candidates
    WHERE full_name % search_term OR email ILIKE (search_term || '%')
    ORDER BY similarity(full_name, search_term) DESC
    LIMIT page_size;
  $$ LANGUAGE sql STABLE;
```

