### 16.2 Breaking Points Analysis

| Breaking Point | Root Cause | Fix |
|---------------|-----------|-----|
| **~100 users: Degradation** | Each user's DashboardLayout fires 4-7 badge queries on each realtime event. 100 users × 5 events/min × 5 queries = 2,500 queries/min | Badge debouncing + aggregate view |
| **~200 users: Connection exhaustion** | Supabase free tier: 200 max connections. Each user holds 1-3 connections (page + realtime channels) | Connection pooling (pgBouncer transaction mode) + shared realtime channels |
| **~500 users: Timeout** | Realtime channels multiply: each user × 5 channels (DashboardLayout + FloatingChatbot) = 2,500 channels | Single shared channel per user |
| **~1000 users: Full outage** | All above compounded + full table scans on every query | All optimizations required |

